                    SubscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["e", FontSlant -> "Bold"], 
                    StyleBox["p", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm], 
                 "\" of the eight units, with the product of the units \
extended bilinearly; real dimension 16\""},
                "RowDefault"],
