                 OverscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "LL"]}], 
              TraditionalForm], 
             "\" (an operator on 16 fermion modes); the superfluid boson \
singlet state, its ground state, a coherent state of pairs; and the normal \
state from which it is built, the Dirac sea of these modes (every state of \
energy \"", 
             FormBox[
              RowBox[{"-", 
                SubscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "LL"]}], TraditionalForm], 
             "\" filled, every state of energy \"", 
             FormBox[
              RowBox[{"+", 
                SubscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "LL"]}], TraditionalForm], 
